---
source: tests/gallery.rs
expression: snapshot
---
--- width 40
*[_type == "article"]
  | score(
    [
      title
    ] match text::query("summer fashion")
  ) {
    title,
    _score,
    "relevance": _score
  }
  | order(_score desc)
--- width 60
